    <string name="add_help_text">ColorDict reads dictionaries in StarDict format. Each dictionary consists of an .ifo, an .idx (or .idx.gz) and a .dict (or .dict.dz) file, plus an optional .syn file.\n\n• “Import dictionary files…” lets you pick the files with the system file picker.\n• “Import folder…” imports every dictionary found in a folder.\n• You can also copy dictionary folders to:\n%s\nand tap “Rescan storage”.</string>

